    "description": "Title\n: Rock Mineral Fossil And Shell Collection Box Assortment Science Kit\nColor\n: Multi\nDepartment\n: Science & Education\nCategory\n: Collectibles & Art\nCondition\n: Good - shows some sign of wear\nDescription\n: Discover an intriguing assortment of rocks, minerals, and shells housed in a handy compartmentalized plastic case. This set includes vibrant mineral clusters, raw geode pieces, and polished as well as natural shells. Notable is a shell decorated with a Sagittarius motif, adding a unique astrological touch to the collection. The selection showcases various colors, textures, and forms, making it ideal for enthusiasts, educational purposes, or display. The case itself is sturdy and features secure yellow clasps, ensuring safe storage and portability. Each specimen is distinct, providing a firsthand look at nature's variety and beauty. The set appears to be in used, clean condition with all pieces intact as shown in the images. Case measures approximately 13 inches in length. Perfect for beginner collectors, students, or as a gift for anyone interested in geology and natural history. Please review all photographs to see the exact items included and current condition\nThis is a pre-owned item donated to Goodwill of Northern Michigan.\nPlease see images for further detail and ask any questions you may have before making a bid.\nItems have been tested for power, not function. In some instances we may not have the necessary equipment to test certain electronics therefore all items will be auctioned off AS-IS with no refunds.\nItems in lots are sold as-is, are not eligible for refunds, and may not be individually wrapped.\nPlease contact us before making payment to review combined shipping options.\nPick-Ups\nWe're open Monday - Friday, 8 am - 4 pm. We are closed on weekends and major holidays. For local pickup in Traverse City, please give us 24 hours from time of payment to prepare your order. Thank you!",
